\"from Université Paris IX - Dauphine in 2016.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"Education\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"Nenna received his Ph.D.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"from Université Paris IX - Dauphine, a French university in Paris, in 2016.\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"[1] At the time, Université Paris IX - Dauphine was an independent university.\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"However, in 2010, it became one of the founding members of PSL University (Paris Sciences & Lettres University), a French university in Paris.\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"[2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"As a result, Luca Nenna can be considered an alumnus of PSL University, having attended one of its constituent universities.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"References:\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"[1] Université Paris IX - Dauphine.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"PhD Programs.\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/dauphine.psl.eu\\\\/en\\\\/phd-programs\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"[2] PSL University.\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Our History.\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.univ-psl.fr\\\\/en\\\\/about\\\\/our-history>\"}, {\"id\": \"s26\", \"text\": \"Please note that this entry is based on the available information and might need further verification and expansion.\"}]}"
